# A write below the check is re-stamped at the receiver's target, as a local
# write would be.
MODULE: UncheckedStoredVerbatimStampedAtTarget
TARGET: UncheckedStoredVerbatim
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: an unjudged entry is stored re-stamped
PERTURBS: Deliver

--- FIND
       ELSE /\ st' = [st EXCEPT ![e] = IF kind[e] = "Atomic" THEN "Staged" ELSE "Stored"]
            /\ tag' = [tag EXCEPT ![e] = stamp[e]]
--- REPLACE
       ELSE /\ st' = [st EXCEPT ![e] = IF kind[e] = "Atomic" THEN "Staged" ELSE "Stored"]
            /\ tag' = [tag EXCEPT ![e] = tgt]
--- END
